          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>You can cast a 3rd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Summon Animal] as an innate spell, but only to summon a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary-2.Actor.Black Bear]. At 10th level, the <em>summon animal</em> spell is heightened to 4th level, and you can summon a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.Grizzly Bear]. At 12th level, your <em>summon animal</em> innate spell is heightened to 5th level, and you can summon a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary-2.Actor.Polar Bear]. At 14th level, it's heightened to 6th level, and you can summon a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.Cave Bear].</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "PT1H"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
